    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Esiteeri naforwa mugo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi obu byamazire kubaho, omukama Ahaswero obu yamazire kurugwaho ekiniga, yaijuka omugo Vasiti na byona omugo ogu ebi akaba amukoliire, yaijuka n'ekiragiro eki yaragiire hali uwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma abaheereza b'omukama abaamuheerezaaga baagambire bati “Baserurre omukama abaisiki abarungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akome abanyoro omu masaza ag'omu bukama bwe, basorooze abaisiki boona abarungi empikirre, babasorooleze omu kikaali Suusa, orubuga orukuru, orwalindwaga Hegai omukonwa w'omukama anyakurolerra abakazi, babahe amagita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwisiki omukama ou arukukira kugonza, nuwe abe mugo, omu kiikaro kya Vasiti.” Eki kikasemereza omukama, na uwe nukwo yakikozire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasumi ako, omu rubuga orukuru Suusa, hakaba haliyo Omuyudaaya ibara lye Morodekayi mutabani wa Yairi, Yairi owa Simeyi, Simeyi owa Kiisi ow'oruganda rwa Benyamiini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.24.10+2KI.24.11+2KI.24.12+2KI.24.13+2KI.24.14+2KI.24.15+2KI.24.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bakam 24:10-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Byok 36:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ow'akaba aihirwe Yerusaalemu, agenderaine omu banyagwa abaatwairwe hamu na Yekonia omukama wa Yuda, Nebukadeneeza omukama wa Babbulooni ou akaba anyagire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuwe akaba ayoroire Hadasa nuwe Esiteeri muhara wa isento omwisiki nuwe akaba ali “nfuuzi” ataina ise kandi ataina nyina; omwisiki akaba asemiire kandi naaligirwa. Ise na nyina obu baamazire kufa, Morodekayi yamwetongorra, yaba nka muhara we ou ayezaaliire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiragiro ky'omukama obu kyarangiriirwe, kandi abaisiki baingi obu baasorooziibwe omu rubuga orukuru Suusa orwalindwaga Hegai, Esiteeri na uwe akatwarwa omu kikaali ky'omukama yakwasibwa Hegai ayalindaga abakazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esiteeri yagonzibwa muno Hegai, yamutaho omutima; yamuha ebintu eby'okwekunisa, yamuha ebyokulya, yamuteeraho abaisiki musanju abaakomerwe omu kikaali ky'omukama, yagenda omba Esiteeri hamu n'abaisiki aba yamukomiire, yamutwara omunju y'abakazi omu kiikaro ekirukukira oburungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esiteeri akaba atakagambire abantu be rundi ab'oruganda rwe; habwokuba Morodekayi akaba amuteereriire ati: eki otalikigamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli kiro, Morodekayi, yaikaraga naarubatarubata omumaiso g'ekizigati ky'enju y'abakazi, naagenderra kumanya Esiteeri nkooku akaba ali, kandi n'ebikaba nibiija kumubaho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orubu orwa buli mwisiki orw'okugenda mb'omukama Ahaswero obu rwahikaga, hahingwireho ameezi ikumi n'abiri omwisiki naakuraatira ebiragiro by'abakazi; habwokuba ako nuko kakaba kali kasumi akaatairweho ak'okwesemeza nugo ameezi mukaaga ag'okwesemeza n'amagita agarumu omugaju, n'ameezi mukaaga gandi naayesemeza n'ebintu ebirukuboya n'amagita ag'esiigwa abakazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwisiki obu yagendaga mb'omukama ahikiriize ebi ebigambirweho, yaheebwaga kyona eki yayendaga kutwara, nukwo aruge omunju y'abakazi, ataahe omu kikaali ky'omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwisiki ogu yagendaga orwebagyo, agaruka nyenkya bukiire, ataaha omunju ey'abakazi ey'akabiri eyalindwaga Saasigazi omukonwa w'omukama, ayaroleerraga abakazi. Omwisiki ogu, mb'omukama tiyagendayoga kabiri, rundi omukama amugondeze muno; obu omwisiki ogu, nubwo yatumwahoga, baija nibeeta ngu: “omwisiki nanka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orubu orw'okugenda mb'omukama, orw'Esiteeri muhara w'Abihairi isento Morodekayi, ayamwetongoliire yamufoora nka muhara we ou yayezaaliire obu rwahikire; atasabe kintu na kimu, okwihaho eki kyonka, Hegai omukonwa w'omukama eki yamugambiire. Boona abaaboine Esiteeri, baamusiima muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu baamuhikize mb'omukama Ahaswero, baamutahya omu kikaali kye eky'obukama omu kwezi okwa ikumi, nukwo okwezi okwa Tebesi, omu mwaka ogwa musanju ogw'engoma ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama yamugonza muno okukira nkooku akaba agondeze abakazi abandi boona. Esiteeri akalyamu omukama Ahaswero omutima okukira Abaisiki abandi boona, nukwo kumujweka ekondo ey'obugo, yamufoora mugo, yamugarra omu kiikaro kya Vasiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma, omukama yacumbira abanyoro be n'abaheereza be boona obugenyi obutagambwa; obugenyi obu bukacumbwa habwa Esiteeri. Kandi yaganyira abantu ab'omumasaza ge kutaha musoro, yagaba ebisembo bingi nkooku omukama agaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Morodekayi naajuna obwomeezi bw'omukama",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiki obu baasorozibwe obwakabiri, Morodekayi akaba aikaliire ha irembo ly'omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasumi ako, Esiteeri akaba atakagambire ab'oruganda rwe rundi ihanga lye, nkooku Morodekayi akaba amuteereriire; habwokuba yahuurraga Morodekayi nkooku yakamworoire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu biro ebi, Morodekayi obu yaikarraga ha irembo ly'omukama, Bigisaana na Teresi, ababiri ha bakonwa b'omukama abaalindaga omulyango baakwatwa ekiniga, baacwa amagezi ag'okukwata omukama Ahaswero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekintu eki, Morodekayi yakimanya, yakigambira omugo Esiteeri omugo yakimanyisa omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekintu eki obu kyayetegereziibwe, kyagumibwa nkooku kiri ky'amazima abasaija abo bombi baabahanika ha muti. Ekintu eki kikahandiikwa omu kitabu eky'obusinge bw'abakama, omukama naarora ati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
